      "source_text": "In the situation above assume that <MATH_0001> is quasi-compact and quasi-separated\nand that <MATH_0002>\n(Derived Categories of Spaces, Section\n<REF_0001>)\nis an isomorphism. Then the functor <MATH_0003> is an equivalence of categories.\n",
