          "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14",
          "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a scheme. Let <MATH_0002>\nbe a morphism of algebraic spaces over <MATH_0003>.\nLet <MATH_0004> be a homomorphism of <MATH_0005>-modules\n(not necessarily quasi-coherent).\nConsider the functor\n<MATH_0006>\ngiven by pushout.",
