    {
      "context_id": "locked-English-reference:defos:inventory:defos:08UG:lemma/0001:defos-lemma-huge-diagram-ringed-topoi",
      "value": {
        "kind": "locked-English-reference",
        "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14",
        "source_unit": {
          "schema_version": 1,
          "unit_id": "inventory:defos:08UG:lemma/0001",
          "parent_tag": "08UE",
          "chapter": "defos",
          "node_kind": "lemma",
          "risk_level": "R3",
          "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14",
          "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nAssume given a commutative diagram of morphisms ringed topoi\n<MATH_0001>\nwhose horizontal arrows are first order thickenings. Set\n<MATH_0002> and assume given a\nmap of <MATH_0003>-modules\n<MATH_0004>\ngiving rise to the commutative diagram\n<MATH_0005>\nwith front and back solutions to (<REF_0001>).\n(The north-north-west arrows are maps on <MATH_0006> after applying\n<MATH_0007> to the source.)\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> There exist a canonical element in\n<MATH_0008>\nwhose vanishing is a necessary and sufficient condition for the existence\nof a morphism of ringed topoi\n<MATH_0009> fitting into\n(<REF_0002>) compatibly with <MATH_0010>.\n<STRUCT_0004> If there exists a morphism\n<MATH_0011>\nfitting into\n(<REF_0003>) compatibly with <MATH_0012> the set\nof all such morphisms is a principal homogeneous space under\n<MATH_0013>\n<STRUCT_0005>\n<STRUCT_0006>",
          "source_status": "CURRENT",
          "placeholders": {
            "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{lemma}",
            "LOCKED_0001": "\\label{lemma-huge-diagram-ringed-topoi}",
            "MATH_0001": "\\begin{equation}\n\\label{equation-huge-1-ringed-topoi}\n\\vcenter{\n\\xymatrix{\n& (\\Sh(\\mathcal{C}_2), \\mathcal{O}_2) \\ar[r]_{i_2} \\ar[d]_{f_2} \\ar[ddl]_g &\n(\\Sh(\\mathcal{C}'_2), \\mathcal{O}'_2) \\ar[d]^{f'_2} \\\\\n&\n(\\Sh(\\mathcal{B}_2), \\mathcal{O}_{\\mathcal{B}_2}) \\ar[r]^{t_2} \\ar[ddl]|\\hole &\n(\\Sh(\\mathcal{B}'_2), \\mathcal{O}_{\\mathcal{B}'_2}) \\ar[ddl] \\\\\n(\\Sh(\\mathcal{C}_1), \\mathcal{O}_1) \\ar[r]_{i_1} \\ar[d]_{f_1} &\n(\\Sh(\\mathcal{C}'_1), \\mathcal{O}'_1) \\ar[d]^{f'_1} \\\\\n(\\Sh(\\mathcal{B}_1), \\mathcal{O}_{\\mathcal{B}_1}) \\ar[r]^{t_1} &\n(\\Sh(\\mathcal{B}'_1), \\mathcal{O}_{\\mathcal{B}'_1})\n}\n}\n\\end{equation}",
            "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{G}_j = \\Ker(i_j^\\sharp)$",
            "MATH_0003": "$g^{-1}\\mathcal{O}_1$",
            "MATH_0004": "$\\nu : g^{-1}\\mathcal{G}_1 \\to \\mathcal{G}_2$",
            "MATH_0005": "\\begin{equation}\n\\label{equation-huge-2-ringed-topoi}\n\\vcenter{\n\\xymatrix{\n& 0 \\ar[r] & \\mathcal{G}_2 \\ar[r] &\n\\mathcal{O}'_2 \\ar[r] &\n\\mathcal{O}_2 \\ar[r] & 0 \\\\\n& 0 \\ar[r]|\\hole &\nf_2^{-1}\\mathcal{J}_2 \\ar[u]_{c_2} \\ar[r] &\nf_2^{-1}\\mathcal{O}_{\\mathcal{B}'_2} \\ar[u] \\ar[r]|\\hole &\nf_2^{-1}\\mathcal{O}_{\\mathcal{B}_2} \\ar[u] \\ar[r] & 0 \\\\\n0 \\ar[r] &\n\\mathcal{G}_1 \\ar[ruu] \\ar[r] &\n\\mathcal{O}'_1 \\ar[r] &\n\\mathcal{O}_1 \\ar[ruu] \\ar[r] & 0 \\\\\n0 \\ar[r] &\nf_1^{-1}\\mathcal{J}_1 \\ar[ruu]|\\hole \\ar[u]^{c_1} \\ar[r] &\nf_1^{-1}\\mathcal{O}_{\\mathcal{B}'_1} \\ar[ruu]|\\hole \\ar[u] \\ar[r] &\nf_1^{-1}\\mathcal{O}_{\\mathcal{B}_1} \\ar[ruu]|\\hole \\ar[u] \\ar[r] & 0\n}\n}\n\\end{equation}",
            "REF_0001": "\\ref{equation-to-solve-ringed-topoi}",
            "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{C}_2$",
            "MATH_0007": "$g^{-1}$",
            "STRUCT_0002": "\\begin{enumerate}",
            "STRUCT_0003": "\\item",
            "MATH_0008": "$\\Ext^1_{\\mathcal{O}_2}(\nLg^*\\NL_{\\mathcal{O}_1/\\mathcal{O}_{\\mathcal{B}_1}}, \\mathcal{G}_2)$",
            "MATH_0009": "$(\\Sh(\\mathcal{C}'_2), \\mathcal{O}'_2) \\to\n(\\Sh(\\mathcal{C}'_1), \\mathcal{O}'_1)$",
            "REF_0002": "\\ref{equation-huge-1-ringed-topoi}",
            "MATH_0010": "$\\nu$",
            "STRUCT_0004": "\\item",
            "MATH_0011": "$(\\Sh(\\mathcal{C}'_2), \\mathcal{O}'_2) \\to\n(\\Sh(\\mathcal{C}'_1), \\mathcal{O}'_1)$",
            "REF_0003": "\\ref{equation-huge-1-ringed-topoi}",
            "MATH_0012": "$\\nu$",
            "MATH_0013": "$$\n\\Hom_{\\mathcal{O}_1}(\n\\Omega_{\\mathcal{O}_1/\\mathcal{O}_{\\mathcal{B}_1}}, g_*\\mathcal{G}_2) =\n\\Hom_{\\mathcal{O}_2}(\ng^*\\Omega_{\\mathcal{O}_1/\\mathcal{O}_{\\mathcal{B}_1}}, \\mathcal{G}_2) =\n\\Ext^0_{\\mathcal{O}_2}(\nLg^*\\NL_{\\mathcal{O}_1/\\mathcal{O}_{\\mathcal{B}_1}}, \\mathcal{G}_2).\n$$",
            "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}",
            "STRUCT_0006": "\\end{lemma}"
          },
          "render": {
            "prefix": "",
            "suffix": ""
          },
          "source_text_hash": "sha256:c3df7ce1dd8df521ef3e4e93a12d212911f960a4b6e4f9cd46f292ba715128f0",
          "source_structure_hash": "sha256:139bf51fbc467860868bc23b8b74e03f05cff427a1f96fadd99d26dd108baa16",
          "source_math_hash": "sha256:bfd7d39bbe3e7bcfa1371e36f78865241af4400696a84bee0970ce32f6b1b8be"
        },
